window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-034-52bb9c75e4d24a2f.json"]={sha256:"52bb9c75e4d24a2fe75e976f9e60778ad265763a468536d389eb67e5949fb956",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-65801462f4a5d615","url":"https://github.com/DEShawResearch/random123","title":"Random123 library","titleEn":"Random123 library","publisher":"D. E. Shaw Research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-034","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-034","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-035","referenceUrls":["https://docs.openmc.org/en/stable/methods/tallies.html"],"title":"Monte Carlo：抽樣誤差與有效樣本","titleEn":"Monte Carlo: sampling error and effective samples","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付counter索引、重分解測試與亂數來源紀錄；317兩次一致，全部樣本身份唯一且key未變；亂數本身由正式實作產生；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver counter indices, repartition tests, and generator provenance. Both index calculations give 317. All sample identities must be unique and use the fixed key; actual draws come from the established implementation. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫試驗→0/1觀察→分組平均，記seed、全域樣本ID及是否重複；兩SE相符，獨立性、樣本唯一性與p來源明示。","differenceEn":"Trace trial, binary observation, and batch mean. Record the seed, global sample identity, and any duplication. Both standard errors must match, with independence, sample uniqueness, and the source of p stated.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["rank r各持m個樣本時全域索引i=r×m+j；不重複的索引配合固定key可跨工作分解追蹤樣本；合成r3、m100、j17；改m50並用r6、j17表示同一全域樣本；名義式 3*100+17 = 317 global sample index；變更式 6*50+17 = 317 global sample index。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","已知教學p時，樣本均值標準差SE=sqrt(p(1−p)/N)，前提是獨立同分布；合成p=.25，N10000對40000；這是模型SE，不是某次量測信賴區間；名義式 sqrt(.25*.75/10000) = 0.00433012701892 probability standard error；變更式 sqrt(.25*.75/40000) = 0.00216506350946 probability standard error。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With m samples per rank, global index i = r m + j. Unique indices with a fixed key preserve sample identity across decompositions. Synthetic r = 3, m = 100, j = 17; compare r = 6, m = 50, j = 17 for the same global sample. Nominal 3*100+17 = 317 global sample index; changed 6*50+17 = 317 global sample index. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","For teaching probability p, the sample-mean standard error is sqrt(p(1−p)/N), assuming independent identically distributed trials. Synthetic p = 0.25, N = 10000 versus 40000. This model standard error is not a measured confidence interval. Nominal sqrt(.25*.75/10000) = 0.00433012701892 probability standard error; changed sqrt(.25*.75/40000) = 0.00216506350946 probability standard error. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-044","referenceUrls":["https://doi.org/10.1145/42411.42415","https://hpc.llnl.gov/documentation/tutorials/introduction-parallel-computing-tutorial"],"title":"Gustafson：固定時間的擴大問題","titleEn":"Gustafson: scaled problems at fixed elapsed time","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付counter索引、重分解測試與亂數來源紀錄；317兩次一致，全部樣本身份唯一且key未變；亂數本身由正式實作產生；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver counter indices, repartition tests, and generator provenance. Both index calculations give 317. All sample identities must be unique and use the fixed key; actual draws come from the established implementation. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫一單位平行時間，串行α與其餘分給32工作者；再反推同工作單處理器時間；28.9/25.8可重算，α定義與問題擴大假設不可省略。","differenceEn":"Draw one unit of parallel time with serial part α. Recover the one-worker time for the same expanded work. Reproduce both values with α and the expanded-problem assumption explicitly defined.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["rank r各持m個樣本時全域索引i=r×m+j；不重複的索引配合固定key可跨工作分解追蹤樣本；合成r3、m100、j17；改m50並用r6、j17表示同一全域樣本；名義式 3*100+17 = 317 global sample index；變更式 6*50+17 = 317 global sample index。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","縮放速度Sscaled=P−α(P−1)，α是平行執行中串行比例，與Amdahl的基準s不可混用；合成P32、α=.1；同P下α=.2作對照；名義式 32-.1*(32-1) = 28.9 scaled speedup；變更式 32-.2*(32-1) = 25.8 scaled speedup。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With m samples per rank, global index i = r m + j. Unique indices with a fixed key preserve sample identity across decompositions. Synthetic r = 3, m = 100, j = 17; compare r = 6, m = 50, j = 17 for the same global sample. Nominal 3*100+17 = 317 global sample index; changed 6*50+17 = 317 global sample index. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Scaled speedup is P − α(P−1), where α is the serial fraction of the parallel run, distinct from Amdahl’s baseline fraction. Synthetic P = 32 and α = 0.1 versus 0.2. Nominal 32-.1*(32-1) = 28.9 scaled speedup; changed 32-.2*(32-1) = 25.8 scaled speedup. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-9227f778168eae54","url":"https://docs.openmc.org/en/stable/methods/tallies.html","title":"OpenMC tally statistics","titleEn":"OpenMC tally statistics","publisher":"OpenMC development team","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-b5af78a03e311b93","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/42411.42415","title":"Reevaluating Amdahl’s law","titleEn":"Reevaluating Amdahl’s law","publisher":"John Gustafson / ACM","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-8646d75e80f37cf7","url":"https://hpc.llnl.gov/documentation/tutorials/introduction-parallel-computing-tutorial","title":"Introduction to Parallel Computing: performance analysis","titleEn":"Introduction to Parallel Computing: performance analysis","publisher":"Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
